- Wait outside my house.

00:33:53.827 --> 00:33:56.497
Go hide in the bushes or something.
Go! Go!

00:34:01.086 --> 00:34:02.379
Back to work.

00:34:03.547 --> 00:34:06.384
I told you, VIPs only.

00:34:08.136 --> 00:34:11.098
Oh, my God. Oh, my God.

00:34:12.558 --> 00:34:16.396
I love you so much!
You are my favorite character.

00:34:16.563 --> 00:34:19.108
- Do you watch The Valley?
- No, I have a job.

00:34:19.275 --> 00:34:20.986
It's only, like, the best show ever.

00:34:21.236 --> 00:34:24.699
You are actually a little shorter
than I imagined, but still, so hot.

00:34:25.700 --> 00:34:27.410
