- You here for the party?

00:34:28.745 --> 00:34:30.998
- Yeah.
- Oh, my God. Wait, can I come with you?

00:34:32.291 --> 00:34:35.712
Seriously, it would mean so much to me.
It really is my favorite show.

00:34:36.547 --> 00:34:39.676
Take advantage, kid.
You're only a teen idol once.

00:34:39.884 --> 00:34:42.721
- Thanks, buddy.
- Thanks too.

00:34:44.682 --> 00:34:46.768
I can't believe we're watching dailies.

00:34:47.018 --> 00:34:49.438
But, seriously, which take
did you like better?

00:34:49.605 --> 00:34:53.151
Because I kind of like the acting
in that one, you know.

00:34:53.318 --> 00:34:55.988
But the lighting wasn't as good
as the one before.

00:34:56.196 --> 00:34:59.575
Okay, I don't know. Could we go back
