00:34:59.868 --> 00:35:03.288
Well, how about some music?

00:35:03.914 --> 00:35:07.210
That'll liven it up. Little party in here.

00:35:07.460 --> 00:35:09.296
Party in my Caddy.

00:35:09.463 --> 00:35:12.633
- What's this?
- This is my band.

00:35:12.884 --> 00:35:15.512
- It's our first CD.
- No kidding.

00:35:16.472 --> 00:35:21.770
I like you. I don't know why,
but you just... You've got...

00:35:21.937 --> 00:35:27.360
You just got something, you know?
I'm a big fan of yours.

00:35:29.363 --> 00:35:32.533
- Oh, my God. What are you doing?
- What...?

00:35:32.784 --> 00:35:34.244
- Cohen.
- Summer.

00:35:34.369 --> 00:35:37.248
- Hi.
- Hi. I heard really awful music...

00:35:37.373 --> 00:35:40.669
...and I knew it could only be
self-indulgent actors with instruments.

00:35:40.919 --> 00:35:42.629
- What are you doing?
- Leaving.

00:35:42.796 --> 00:35:45.675
- Grady, there you are.
- April, hi.

00:35:45.800 --> 00:35:47.802
Oh, my God. You're on the show.

00:35:48.094 --> 00:35:51.056
- You're the best thing on the show.
- What are you doing with her?

00:35:51.265 --> 00:35:55.687
- I...
- Wait. You two are dating? Oh, God.

00:35:55.938 --> 00:35:57.523
Don't you think that's a bad idea?

00:35:57.731 --> 00:36:00.151
What if things don't work out
and you guys break up?

00:36:00.402 --> 00:36:02.654
- Isn't that bad for the show?
- Guess we're about to find out.

00:36:02.863 --> 00:36:06.284
Whoa... April! Hey, lock up
the car for me, please.

00:36:06.534 --> 00:36:07.994
April, wait.

00:36:09.037 --> 00:36:10.289
Hey.

00:36:15.128 --> 00:36:19.175
I'm sorry. Let's go home.
Someplace with real people.

00:36:19.300 --> 00:36:23.305
Think we'll find that at home? We live in
Newport Beach. Let's just get out of L.A.

00:36:23.555 --> 00:36:25.057
I love her, and she loves me.

00:36:25.266 --> 00:36:27.143
Is that a new episode?

00:36:27.310 --> 00:36:30.022
- Oh, Grady's probably ad-libbing.
- I already saw it.

00:36:35.862 --> 00:36:37.740
- What are you guys doing?
- Come with us.

00:36:37.907 --> 00:36:41.036
Your whole "save the stripper" campaign
is sweet, but I'm fine.

00:36:41.286 --> 00:36:42.287
- Oh, you're fine?
- Yeah.

00:36:42.496 --> 00:36:44.498
Get out of here quick,
before he sees you.

00:36:44.749 --> 00:36:46.334
No, not without you.
Look, we came...

00:36:46.584 --> 00:36:48.754
- What you doing in my club?
- Get your hand off me.

00:36:48.920 --> 00:36:51.340
Gonna have a problem now. Out.
You too, Hailey.

00:36:52.508 --> 00:36:53.802
Goodbye. Goodbye, Hailey.

00:36:55.721 --> 00:36:58.808
What are you gonna do now, big shot?
What are you gonna do now?

00:36:59.058 --> 00:37:00.727
What are you gonna do, hit a kid?

00:37:01.394 --> 00:37:02.646
Dad?

00:37:03.063 --> 00:37:06.734
- What are you, the dad?
- What are you?

00:37:06.943 --> 00:37:09.780
The guy who's my age
and still thinks he's 25?

00:37:13.409 --> 00:37:15.495
You keep your kids out of my club.

00:37:18.958 --> 00:37:21.086
- Are you all right?
- Yeah.

00:37:21.378 --> 00:37:25.132
- Look, Sandy got held up, so...
- That's okay. Thank you.

00:37:25.967 --> 00:37:29.221
Why don't you guys head back.
I'm gonna give Hailey a lift.

00:37:30.264 --> 00:37:32.517
Okay, we'll just go find Seth and Summer.

00:37:32.684 --> 00:37:34.102
All right.

00:37:36.814 --> 00:37:38.524
Drive safe.

00:37:43.405 --> 00:37:45.700
I wish you would've called first.

00:37:45.950 --> 00:37:47.744
I would've washed my hair.

00:37:49.580 --> 00:37:50.748
Are you okay?

00:37:52.291 --> 00:37:53.710
I'm fine.

00:37:53.877 --> 00:37:58.132
I just was supposed to get a job
managing this other bar...

00:37:58.299 --> 00:37:59.425
...and it fell through...

00:37:59.676 --> 00:38:02.012
...and I needed money...
- It's okay. It's okay.

00:38:02.763 --> 00:38:05.266
It's all right. It doesn't matter.

00:38:08.603 --> 00:38:09.897
It doesn't matter.

00:38:13.610 --> 00:38:15.153
So you wanna come home?

00:38:18.282 --> 00:38:19.450
Yeah.

00:38:25.458 --> 00:38:27.627
And could we have parked
any further away?

00:38:27.794 --> 00:38:31.716
Hey. We get to look forward to a little
Saturday-night rush hour.

00:38:31.883 --> 00:38:34.302
You know, I think we did
pretty good in there, man.

00:38:34.469 --> 00:38:37.515
I told you we make a good team.
I'm the brains, you're the brawn.

00:38:37.765 --> 00:38:40.226
How come you're the brains?
I talked us back into the club.

00:38:40.477 --> 00:38:42.187
I'm sorry. I'm the brains.

00:38:42.437 --> 00:38:44.190
- You can be the beauty.
- Okay, thanks.

00:38:44.482 --> 00:38:46.901
You're the beauty, he's the brawn,
I'm the brains.

00:38:47.068 --> 00:38:49.446
Great. And what am I, Cohen?

00:38:49.780 --> 00:38:52.492
- The boobs? The bitch?
- Okay.

00:38:52.658 --> 00:38:55.662
- I'll take "the boobs."
- Hey, so will I.

00:38:58.791 --> 00:39:00.919
I've never seen so much meat loaf
in my life.

00:39:01.086 --> 00:39:02.796
It was a beautiful sight.

00:39:02.963 --> 00:39:06.217
Hey. Where were you? It went great.

00:39:06.384 --> 00:39:09.555
I have a surprise.

00:39:16.939 --> 00:39:18.107
Oh, my God.

00:39:18.357 --> 00:39:20.402
Yeah. I just picked her up
from the airport.

00:39:20.568 --> 00:39:23.238
- Fresh from Turks and Caicos.
- I hear that's the best Club Med there is.

00:39:23.405 --> 00:39:25.283
I can't wait to hear the details.

00:39:31.791 --> 00:39:33.835
Thanks, Jimmy.
For bringing her back.

00:39:39.550 --> 00:39:42.554
- Why don't I draw you a bath.
- Yeah.

00:39:50.773 --> 00:39:52.608
Well, we should wrap this up.

00:39:53.151 --> 00:39:55.320
- Do some business.
- And there is my cue.

00:39:55.570 --> 00:39:59.993
You boys discuss the money.
Call me when you want to discuss linens.

00:40:00.869 --> 00:40:02.287
Okay, fellas, I'm in.

00:40:03.330 --> 00:40:06.292
- And we'll do it your way.
- It's the only way we could do it.

00:40:07.043 --> 00:40:09.463
You guys were right.
At the end of the day...

00:40:09.713 --> 00:40:12.175
...it's good food, good people
coming together.

00:40:13.218 --> 00:40:17.056
- Tonight was a good start.
- Apparently.

00:40:19.350 --> 00:40:20.727
Thanks.

00:40:23.105 --> 00:40:25.942
- Luke, what is so important that...?
- We can't do this anymore.

00:40:27.193 --> 00:40:28.487
Excuse me?

00:40:30.489 --> 00:40:32.658
You're breaking up with me?

00:40:33.660 --> 00:40:37.248
It's just...
It's not a good idea.

00:40:37.498 --> 00:40:39.751
And it never could've worked.

00:40:45.049 --> 00:40:46.509
You're right.

00:40:47.677 --> 00:40:49.471
Well, okay.

00:40:55.145 --> 00:40:56.939
Right.

00:40:58.399 --> 00:40:59.525
Okay.

00:41:12.709 --> 00:41:15.253
Hi, Cal. It's me.

00:41:15.420 --> 00:41:18.257
When you're ready for that date,
let me know.

00:41:19.550 --> 00:41:22.262
Can't believe they're watching
The Valley after all that.

00:41:22.429 --> 00:41:24.598
Hey, Summer says it's addictive.

00:41:24.849 --> 00:41:27.727
