Not watching TV?

00:41:27.894 --> 00:41:29.438
Yeah, sure.

00:41:35.904 --> 00:41:37.698
So did you have fun tonight?

00:41:37.865 --> 00:41:40.702
Watching you get kicked
out of a club? Twice?

00:41:40.869 --> 00:41:44.206
- Yeah, actually, I kind of did.
- You were pretty good with the bouncer.

00:41:44.457 --> 00:41:45.792
- Impressed?
- I kind of was.

00:41:46.000 --> 00:41:48.795
- See, I think I should be the brains.
- No. Seth's the brains.

00:41:49.004 --> 00:41:52.049
- Well, you're clearly not the beauty.
- And now someone's the bitch.

00:41:52.592 --> 00:41:53.760
- Oh, really? Okay.
- Yeah.

00:41:54.177 --> 00:41:55.595
Hey, hey.

00:41:57.139 --> 00:41:58.599
- Come on, fight back.
- All right.

00:42:00.643 --> 00:42:04.148
- I win.
- Yeah. Yeah, you win.

00:42:04.356 --> 00:42:06.317
I'll be right back.

00:42:10.656 --> 00:42:14.494
- Hey, Mrs. Cohen. Is Ryan around?
- Yeah. He's in the pool house.

00:42:18.040 --> 00:42:19.500
- Luke.
- It's over.

00:42:19.626 --> 00:42:21.795
- I'm done having sex with Julie Cooper.
- Okay.

00:42:27.093 --> 00:42:28.762
Marissa.

00:42:35.103 --> 00:42:39.359
- You...
- Okay. Wait, wait. Just stop.

00:42:41.653 --> 00:42:42.821
Marissa.

00:42:43.238 --> 00:42:46.534
- So that's why you took me to L.A.?
- I didn't want you to find out.

00:42:46.701 --> 00:42:48.286
Not like this.

00:42:52.792 --> 00:42:54.711
I've gotta go.
